<title>FINLAND: Finnish August wholesale prices rise 0.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish August wholesale prices rise 0.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish wholesale price index fell 0.3 percent in August on July and it rose 0.2 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			     August 1996    July 1996    August 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth		    -0.3 pct	+0.4 pct	-0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr			+0.2 pct	+0.5 pct	-0.5 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
